      {
        "query_id": "CH-004",
        "query": "For an Apex Platinum balance transfer, explain the introductory offer and fee conditions, processing time and responsibility for old account payments.",
        "mode": "graph_enhanced",
        "status": "completed",
        "document_coverage": 1.0,
        "citation_coverage_proxy": 1.0,
        "manual_answer_completeness": null,
        "response": {
          "request_id": "f54b967d-824a-4095-90fa-806427fd34f0",
          "answer": "### Apex Platinum 余额转账政策说明\n\n**1.  introductory 优惠与费用条件**\n*   **优惠利率**：在开户后 60 天内申请的余额转账，可享受 15 个账单周期的 0% 介绍性年利率 (APR) [2]。\n*   **转账费用**：每笔转账收取 3% 或 10 美元（以较高者为准）的费用 [2]。\n*   **后续利率**：介绍期结束后，标准余额转账 APR 将根据信用状况在 18.24% 至 28.24% 之间浮动 [2]。\n*   **限制条件**：无法在现有的 Apex 账户之间进行转账 [2]。\n\n**2. 处理时间**\n*   标准余额转账请求需要 5 到 7 个工作日进行处理并支付给外部发卡行 [1]。\n*   不提供加急转账服务 [1]。\n\n**3. 旧账户还款责任**\n*   在转账金额出现在 Apex 信用卡账单之前，持卡人仍需负责向外部账户付款 [1]。\n*   若介绍期结束前未还清余额，剩余部分将从过期之日起按日计息 [3]。",
          "citations": [
            {
              "id": 1,
              "doc_id": "DOC-0005",
              "chunk_id": "5b217fa602bc478808660085",
              "quote": "Standard balance transfer requests take 5 to 7 business days to process and pay out to external card issuers. Expedited transfers are not available. Payments to external accounts continue to be the cardholder's responsibility until the transferred amount appears on the Apex credit statement."
            },
            {
              "id": 2,
              "doc_id": "DOC-0001",
              "chunk_id": "2fb88d60ca94ba92661b09bd",
              "quote": "Promotional 0% intro APR applies for 15 billing cycles from account opening on balance transfers requested within 60 days of account creation. A balance transfer fee of 3% or $10 (whichever is greater) applies to each transfer. Standard balance transfer APR ranges from 18.24% to 28.24% variable based on creditworthiness after the intro period ends. Transfers cannot be made between existing Apex accounts."
            },
            {
              "id": 3,
              "doc_id": "DOC-0009",
              "chunk_id": "0e9b6fb93acd28cb46c1d1cd",
              "quote": "If a balance transfer amount is not paid off before the introductory period ends, interest accrues daily on the remaining balance from the expiration date onward. Payments above the minimum monthly payment are automatically allocated to the balance with the highest APR first."
            }
          ],
          "retrieval": {
