                    "text": "Standard balance transfer requests take 5 to 7 business days to process and pay out to external card issuers. Expedited transfers are not available. Payments to external accounts continue to be the cardholder's responsibility until the transferred amount appears on the Apex credit statement.",
                    "parent_id": "DOC-0005:policy",
                    "start_char": 133,
                    "end_char": 425
                  }
                ]
              },
