                "score": 0.7232195881627794,
                "evidence": [
                  {
                    "chunk_id": "2fb88d60ca94ba92661b09bd",
                    "text": "Promotional 0% intro APR applies for 15 billing cycles from account opening on balance transfers requested within 60 days of account creation. A balance transfer fee of 3% or $10 (whichever is greater) applies to each transfer. Standard balance transfer APR ranges from 18.24% to 28.24% variable based on creditworthiness after the intro period ends. Transfers cannot be made between existing Apex accounts.",
