                "score": 0.6310331932414588,
                "evidence": [
                  {
                    "chunk_id": "0e9b6fb93acd28cb46c1d1cd",
                    "text": "If a balance transfer amount is not paid off before the introductory period ends, interest accrues daily on the remaining balance from the expiration date onward. Payments above the minimum monthly payment are automatically allocated to the balance with the highest APR first.",
